---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../site.config';
import professionalExperience from '../data/professional-experience.json';
import technicalExpertise from '../data/technical-expertise.json';
---

<Layout title={`About - ${site.title}`} description="Learn more about Farhan and his technical expertise">
	<div class="nes-container is-dark with-title">
		<p class="title">👨‍💻 About Me</p>
		
		<div class="nes-container is-rounded">
			<div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
				<h2 style="margin: 0;">{site.author}</h2>
			</div>
			
			<div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
				<h3 style="color: #92cc41; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🚀 Who I Am</h3>
				<p style="font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.8;">
					I'm a Software Engineer at <strong>freeCodeCamp</strong>, where I lead the design and development of the Python curriculum, 
					shaping how millions of learners worldwide practice programming. With 7+ years of backend engineering experience, 
					I've built scalable systems across SaaS, media, and fintech - from multi-tenant platforms to high-traffic digital journalism sites. 
					I'm also a technical author whose handbooks on Docker, Kubernetes, NGINX, and other technologies have been read by over 500,000 developers globally.
				</p>
			</div>
			
			<div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
				<h3 style="color: #92cc41; margin-bottom: 1rem;">💼 Professional Journey</h3>
				<div style="font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 2;">
					{professionalExperience.map((role) => (
						<div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
							<strong style="color: #92cc41;">{role.title}</strong> - {role.company}<br/>
							{role.period && (
								<>
									<span style="color: #888;">{role.period}</span><br/>
								</>
							)}
							{role.description}
						</div>
					))}
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
				<h3 style="color: #92cc41; margin-bottom: 1rem;">💡 Technical Expertise</h3>
				<div class="skills-grid">
					{technicalExpertise.map((skill) => (
						<span class="skill-chip">{skill}</span>
					))}
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
				<h3 style="color: #92cc41; margin-bottom: 1rem;">✍️ Writing & Teaching</h3>
				<p style="font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					My mission is to make complex technical concepts accessible. I've authored <strong>5 comprehensive handbooks</strong> 
					including The Docker Handbook, The Kubernetes Handbook, The NGINX Handbook, The Arch Linux Handbook, and The Python Code Example Handbook - 
					collectively read by <strong>500,000+ developers</strong>. I also produce video courses sponsored by industry leaders like MongoDB, 
					Replit, and Neo4j, with over 3 million total views.
				</p>
				<p style="font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.8;">
					I contribute technical articles to <strong>freeCodeCamp</strong>, <strong>Laravel News</strong>, and other platforms, 
					focusing on practical solutions, best practices, and hands-on tutorials that help developers solve real-world problems.
				</p>
			</div>
			
			<div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
				<h3 style="color: #92cc41; margin-bottom: 1rem;">📚 Beyond Code</h3>
				<p style="font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.8;">
					When I'm not building systems or writing tutorials, you'll find me exploring stories. I'm an avid reader of fiction - 
					especially mystery, horror, philosophy, and classics. From Dostoevsky to contemporary Japanese literature, 
					reading keeps me grounded and reminds me that great software, like great stories, is fundamentally about solving human problems. 
					Check out my <a href="/books" style="color: #92cc41; text-decoration: underline;">reading journey</a> to see what I'm currently into.
				</p>
			</div>
			
			<div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
				<h3 style="color: #92cc41; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🔗 Let's Connect</h3>
				<p style="font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					I'm always open to interesting conversations about backend engineering, technical writing, or just good books. 
					Feel free to reach out!
				</p>
				<div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
					<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="nes-btn is-success">
						Email Me
					</a>
					<a href="https://github.com/fhsinchy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="nes-btn is-primary">
						GitHub
					</a>
					<a href="https://twitter.com/frhnhsin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="nes-btn is-info">
						Twitter
					</a>
					<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/farhanhasin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="nes-btn">
						LinkedIn
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem;">
				<a href="/writing" class="nes-btn is-warning">Browse Articles</a>
				<a href="/books" class="nes-btn is-primary">Bookshelf</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.skills-grid {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.skill-chip {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
		border: 2px solid #92cc41;
		color: #fff;
		background: #212529;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		line-height: 1.4;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.skills-grid {
			gap: 0.5rem;
		}

		.skill-chip {
			font-size: 0.6rem;
			padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem;
		}
		
		h3 {
			font-size: 0.85rem !important;
			margin-bottom: 0.75rem !important;
		}
		
		p {
			font-size: 0.7rem !important;
			line-height: 1.6 !important;
		}
		
		strong {
			font-size: 0.7rem !important;
		}
	}
</style>
